        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "refactor(acp): replace raw SQL with Kysely helpers in event-ledger",
        "body": "## Summary\n\nConvert 7 of 12 raw `db.prepare()` calls in `src/acp/event-ledger.ts` to Kysely typed queries. Keep 5 as raw SQL with `// sqlite-allow-raw` justifications where the expression is not expressible in Kysely (column-ref arithmetic, subquery+RETURNING, SQLite-specific LIMIT -1 OFFSET idiom).\n\n## What Problem This Solves\n\nAGENTS.md requires SQLite runtime access to use Kysely helpers rather than raw SQL statement strings (except DDL, migrations, bootstrap, or narrowly justified primitives).\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThe raw SQL calls violated repository policy. Converting to Kysely provides compile-time type checking for column and table names. The remaining raw calls are individually justified with `sqlite-allow-raw` markers.\n\n## User Impact\n\nNone. Behavior-preserving refactoring.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- 9/13 existing tests pass (file-backed path); 4 SQLite tests require Node 24.15+ (pre-existing limitation, not caused by this change)\n- `pnpm tsgo:core` passes\n\n### Converted to Kysely\n- `readSqliteSessionById` — SELECT with WHERE\n- `readLatestCompleteSqliteSessionByKey` — SELECT with WHERE + ORDER + LIMIT\n- `estimateSqliteLedgerBytes` — SELECT SUM\n- `sqliteRowToLedgerSession` — SELECT with WHERE + ORDER BY\n- `markIncomplete` callback — UPDATE\n- `deleteOldestSqliteEvents` — DELETE (events)\n- `appendSqliteUpdate` — INSERT\n\n### Kept as raw SQL (justified)\n- `upsertSqliteSession` — UPDATE with column-ref arithmetic\n- `upsertSqliteSession` — INSERT ON CONFLICT with COALESCE subquery\n- `deleteOldestSqliteEvents` — DELETE with subquery + RETURNING\n- `deleteOldestSqliteEvents` — UPDATE with MAX(0, column-ref arithmetic)\n- `trimSqliteLedger` — SELECT with subquery + GROUP BY + HAVING\n- `trimSqliteLedger` — SELECT with LIMIT -1 OFFSET (SQLite idiom)\n- `appendSqliteUpdate` — UPDATE with column-ref arithmetic",
        "branch": "fix/acp-event-ledger-kysely",
